# Client components (Next.js)

- Put `"use client"` only on the **server → client entry** (currently `practice_provider.tsx` from `app/page.tsx`).
- Do **not** add `"use client"` to every `*_ui.tsx` or hook module; they are already in the client bundle when imported below the provider.
- Extra `"use client"` files make the Next TypeScript plugin treat each file as a boundary entry and warn that props like `onConfirm`, `onGrade`, and `practiceRepository` are not serializable (Server Action naming is **not** the fix — shrinking the boundary is).
- Server → client props must be JSON-serializable; pass callbacks and repository instances only **between client components** under the provider.
